  {
    "index": 155,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "F\u00E9licitations\u202F!\\nVotre Pok\u00E9dex a progress\u00E9\u202F!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 156,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "Il vous reste encore des Pok\u00E9mon \u00E0 capturer\u202F!\\nCourage\u202F!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 157,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Tous les Pok\u00E9mon des environs ont \u00E9t\u00E9 captur\u00E9s\u202F!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 158,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Tous les Pok\u00E9mon du Pok\u00E9dex ont \u00E9t\u00E9 captur\u00E9s\u202F!\\nF\u00E9licitations\u202F!\\c\\nMais il reste encore des formes alternatives\\net des versions chromatiques \u00E0 trouver\u202F!\\c\\nAttrapez-les toutes\u202F!\\c"
  },
  {
